    "Name": "Black Rose BRO-2A",
    "Details": "An artillery only version of the Black Rose, mounting both a Long Tom and a Hellstorm Artillery. Purely meant as a backline, long distance support 'Mech, the design has no other weapons except two re-engineered small lasers to help it if engaged in close combat. Utilizing a torso mounted cockpit allows the QuadMech to better designate the firing zones as it allows a 360 degree oversight.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.29</color></b>",
